    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f5b0174a27ad26b0bac5d84",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "既然被那样子看待的话，我就更应该\\n成为大家所期待的「光芒」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb2b91911c67d4d9a19d2893d1d055360d466e6c0b8db14b1e1cac7696662e61",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "581"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/581"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0297590fa730796a8c81230b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对，我很高兴！大概是因为我从小开始，\\n就听着父亲的歌长大的缘故吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e4fff037b097f676f90861e850f862d66cfae766973a57bc3ce6cfd0b7e73d0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "582"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/582"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba6f983023b6657d98784a7c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "怒涛那融入感情和有着精湛转音的歌声……\\n啊，很抱歉我不是在讲竞赛的事情！",
      "source_fingerprint": "501d1bf9bd1219326823b3f56a0c876a23fae7865f82b7ea313eecaae28c8c7c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "583"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/583"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21a9bf829846cd8fbd461b18",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有一点……但紧张时只要回想起以前和小钻\\n一起奔跑的事情，就会冷静下来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea5b0c559139b931a8020a928468ea6e1f1f7dcce43dcf3a2e6613661ee3cb6b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "584"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/584"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62bacfc02a576dd0f0806189",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "谢谢！感觉我距离自己所向往的\\n背影又更近一步了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f787c32cde50ec900e122d9d0459443976eae4185bee60035b88eff1bd07bee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "585"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/585"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d3930e208b7fbbbd41b0768",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我把在这场竞赛中发现到的事情写下来了！\\n是想要在决赛前克服的问题点……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "06874c8b63bbaf2340cad750ef0fd0dab1604941edc6681ee16d043efef5cc5d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "586"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/586"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a486fa8b3420a803738d6fd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有、有的……但因为「进入闸门后就是\\n武藏与小次郎」！不论是谁我都会全力以赴！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22e80acb27d6cf6447220c2b840d4ee87858adf564e5b616cd5ea68b4d059d4b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "587"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/587"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2699b4cb5dd2d343bdd5e144",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "乳清蛋白。青花菜。菲力牛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "175ada32ccb2738aeb57c978378f33481d9d90358559a657f843cf6b599466da",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "588"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/588"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93846ad273683e42e105c6f1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯，小狗。比赛时也会紧跟过来，\\n是个听话的好孩子喔？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f054edd1f24f59dd021638d61081b8c09e45540d80ef2ff2f4aa770181dbf62b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "589"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/589"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8eeae685ffb07c84a1619694",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "都、都是多亏训练员为了今天，\\n帮我设计了各式各样训练项目的缘故……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1bfe087d5da15c4519912135380afcd75e697f527039988ec7b961df4f3af50",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "59"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/59"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d1a2ea1e55121bd24030cab",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这种问题的答案只有一个吧。\\n闪耀的一等星……看着我就够了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b4c4d31a537b13874feb3ea72a740829c3f99659c0e25e0783020ccf6df8aac",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "590"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/590"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12cd0b87d05947aebe02881e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我下场比赛的目标也是要用尽全力\\n在大家心中留下印象。还请看着我的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "93cbc2dd5f2977e598021195d9bfc3cf76b9caf5f1e3c1cd5312a417ec6cb460",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "591"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/591"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:beead3952672a67cf47ef4e2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我跑得相当舒服……\\n对我来说，没有比这更值得感到喜悦的事情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e6a8b01578dbb1ba1c6a6754071d7b430afe7eae8c14d87ed7efd34847d30b5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "592"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/592"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ebab60904e2e93d94156a83",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我一定会赌上自己的一切，\\n持续跑到决赛为止。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00092ebd2f7851859e4c84981b4c5b8c192a686b783b198596edca43d69d3263",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "593"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/593"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7786a8c19c909bc2b2200883",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论有多想努力锻炼，若没有人给予指引\\n便会误入歧途。而你正是我的路标！",
      "source_fingerprint": "730d9c8eac5111e09f383b087985ec66c3f8d50be8304172233f665e710efe26",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "594"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/594"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d1e56dc6960a256002c39a5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我从现在起要去将八重垣流的强悍之处和精神\\n传达到竞赛的世界！请多指教！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fd14ec2cc1058881d21c6491167efe448022a4c71a2131c9b25a34dda50ef17",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "595"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/595"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d3a914d3696aedd6434c7d8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "卸下一切的伪装，拿出自己的一切互相较劲。\\n这恰恰等同于以真本事交锋的对决。",
      "source_fingerprint": "06ee65043002bd292ec05f109471bd733fd3385e7d33df38657693ff3733c618",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "596"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/596"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0828bb1c8a252232c969361f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯！所以推荐大家也都去喝喝看蜂蜜特饮喔！\\n虽然我就算没喝也跑得很快就是了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6f3438694280a7eff94da5b011d877c558f3e456b88c4703debd7397f9b35d9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "6"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/6"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:224856abfa12b5c9f6fa012d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "会觉得我这么幸福真的可以吗……啊，不过\\n还有决赛要比！我、我会虾油的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f843e5a53c4dc98f927bb867e7ff1dde9d097b906894c115cb1021a2d7fd41a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "60"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/60"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7f2e90c6d05b8e56979aa67",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就只能去累积能超越她们的修练成果了呢～\\n正所谓「没有能战胜努力的天赋」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "80c677cc22508f59eea059f0a41a4a6c2318a98b625c0bacaa061347e7e13594",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "600"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/232/600"
    }
  ]
